# PLAN_CONSOLIDATION 1.2 (dd), Dave 2026-10-22 (BRIEF_to_cleanup_round1): ImageDemo.in, the 3.2 listing's
#   Cassegrain-and-relay deck (docs/macos-manual/examples/, Appendix A), carried `PropType= Annulus` on its
#   three obscurations (SEC_OBS, SPIDER_2, SPIDER_3) -- not a PropType name; the loader named it and applied
#   the default, Geometric.  The deck now says Geometric, the value it always traced with (0 movers).  The
#   loader now REFUSES an unknown PropType (Dave 2026-10-22; gate PROPTYPE_numeric.jou), so the old deck
#   would not load at all.  Red on the pre-fix deck.
old $ROOT/docs/macos-manual/examples/ImageDemo.in
show 1
# EXPECT: ImageDemo\.in\s+being loaded
# EXPECT: PropType=\s*Geometric
# EXPECT-NOT: not recognized: the default applies
# EXPECT-NOT: Annulus
# EXPECT-NOT: forrtl
